# Railway build context, uploaded by `railway up` from the repo root.
#
# The CD job deploys from the repo root (not apps/api) so that the service's
# dashboard "Root Directory" setting — apps/api — applies identically to CLI
# uploads and GitHub-triggered deploys. Railway scopes the build to that
# directory; everything stripped below just keeps the upload small.
#
# .gitignore is respected too, so node_modules/, .venv/, *.db, dist/ and
# apps/api/uploads/ are already excluded and are not repeated here.

# Other workspaces — the backend build never reads them.
apps/web/

